    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{\n`Generate a new hyper-realistic ASMR glass fruit slicing video.\n\nPreviously uploaded videos:\n${$('Get row(s) in sheet').all()\n  .map(item => item.json[\"Video Title\"])\n  .filter(Boolean)\n  .join('\\n')}\n\nPreviously rejected titles:\n${($json.rejectedTitles ?? []).join('\\n')}\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Identify the fruits in all previous and rejected titles.\n- Never reuse those fruits.\n- Choose a completely different fruit.\n- Keep the video in vertical 9:16 format.\n- Follow the system instructions.\n- Return prompt, videofile, and videoDescription.`\n}}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are an expert prompt engineer specializing in hyper-realistic ASMR video generation prompts.\nYour task is to generate a complete, detailed video generation prompt based on the following strict template.\nRules you must follow every time:\n\nReplace the fruit with a completely different, realistic whole fruit each time (never repeat the same fruit across generations).\nKeep the fruit made of transparent jelly glass with a soft light-colored outer hue that matches the natural color of the chosen fruit.\nThe video must remain a real vertical smartphone video recorded in true portrait mode (9:16). The camera must be physically vertical. Do NOT simulate 9:16 by rotating horizontal footage.\nOnly the hand, knife, and fruit are visible.\nASMR slicing sounds only — no talking, no music.\nUltra-sharp macro lens, shallow depth of field, cinematic lighting, 4K, 30 FPS.\nStructure the output exactly like this:\n\nVideo Title:\n\n[Create a short, catchy, SEO-friendly title]\nCaption:\n\n[Write an engaging social-media style caption with relevant hashtags]\nVideo Prompt:\n\nThis is a real vertical smartphone video recorded in portrait mode (9:16). The camera must be physically vertical. Do NOT simulate 9:16 by rotating horizontal footage. A hyper-realistic cinematic close-up of a whole, full-shaped [FRUIT NAME] made of transparent jelly glass with a soft light-colored outer hue — for example, pale yellow for a banana, light red for an apple, gentle orange for a carrot. The glass item is perfectly centered on a wooden cutting board, glowing subtly under studio lighting. A human hand is clearly visible, holding a sharp stainless steel knife just above the fruit, ready to slice. In slow motion, the knife makes the first clean slice through the glass fruit — the front section breaks off cleanly with delicate jelly-crack sounds. Then, the knife immediately makes a second slice, cutting another piece smoothly. Transparent shards scatter lightly from both cuts. ASMR slicing sounds only — no talking, no music. Only the hand, knife, and fruit are visible. Ultra-sharp macro lens, shallow depth of field, cinematic lighting, 4K, 30 FPS.\nGenerate one new variation now. Choose a different fruit from previous ones.\n\nMake your output in JSON format:\n\n{\n\"prompt\":\"<insert generated prompt here>\",\n\"videofile\":\"<insert generated video title here>\",\n\"videoDescription\":\"<insert generated video description here>\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
